<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ampolex year net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ampolex year net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    70.38 vs 94.81</p>
<p>    Net				loss 11.90 vs loss 169.43</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  366.60 vs 407.51</p>
<p>    Other income			  46.50 vs 42.55</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 7.10 vs loss 61.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 44.92 vs loss 242.44</p>
<p>    Tax				     37.36 vs 21.81</p>
<p>    Interest				15.48 vs 22.40</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 146.57 vs 144.41</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Ampolex Ltd is an oil and gas producer currently in the process of being taken over by U.S.-based oil firm Mobil Corp which holds over 99.5 percent of Ampolex's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
